ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi214: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with single B-spline edge; fig8_edge: degree-3 B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS from (5,5,0) to (5,-5,0) crossing itself at origin (0,0,0) IS the figure-8 self-intersection; control points: (5,5,0),(-10,5,0),(-10,-5,0),(5,-5,0) via (0,0,0) crossing; FixSelfIntersection split produces two wires not topological fault IS defect; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; fig8_edge IS wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
